1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,460
A mother brought her sick son to the Prophet (peace be upon him).

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:04,490
So what did he say to him?

3
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:09,900
Ahmad narrated that the Prophet (peace be upon him) was brought a boy afflicted by jinn possession.

4
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:12,540
The Prophet (peace be upon him) began to say:

5
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,350
“Come out, enemy of Allah!

6
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:15,750
I am the Messenger of Allah.”

7
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,760
and the boy recovered, by Allah’s permission.

8
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:21,250
This is a hadith whose chain al-Hakim graded sound, and al-Dhahabi agreed.

9
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:25,840
In it, the Prophet (peace be upon him) addressed the harm within the boy with the truth,

10
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:28,030
and did not leave the mother and her son alone.

11
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:32,600
But this is specific to what is established from the Prophet (peace be upon him), and to people of knowledge,

12
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:34,850
and it is not for you to do the same with every sick person.

13
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:38,600
For many children, the illness is physical or psychological.

14
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,290
So if your child falls ill, protect him with the Qur’an and the adhkar,

15
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:43,370
and take him to the doctor right away.

16
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:47,000
Share this story with someone you love, and follow the channel.

